# Vastra — Consolidated Requirements Specification

> A marketplace connecting customers with local tailors across India

---

## Roles

| Role | Description |
|------|-------------|
| **Customer** | Browses, orders, reviews |
| **Tailor** | Manages profile, receives & fulfils orders |
| **Admin** | Moderates platform, manages disputes, views analytics |

---

## 1. Authentication & User Management

- Register via **Email + Password** or **Phone OTP**
- Social login (Google)
- Role selection at signup (Customer / Tailor)
- JWT-based session management
- Forgot password / reset flow
- Profile edit & account deletion

### Tailor-Specific Onboarding
- Submit verification documents (Aadhaar / business proof) — admin approves before profile goes live

---

## 2. Customer Features

### 2.1 Product Browsing
- Browse by **category** → Men / Women / Kids → Ethnic / Western → Shirt, Kurta, Lehenga, etc.
- View **design options** per product (collar types, sleeve styles, embroidery patterns)
- Filter by: price range, product type, fabric type
- Reference image upload ("I want something like this")

### 2.2 Tailor Discovery
- Search & filter tailors by: location, specialization, rating, price range, experience
- GPS-based "**Tailors near me**"
- Sort by: rating, distance, price (low-high / high-low), experience

### 2.3 Tailor Profile (public view)
- Name, photo, base location on map
- Specializations & expertise areas
- Years of experience
- Portfolio gallery (photos of completed work)
- Service area (delivery radius / pan-India)
- Starting prices per product category
- Reviews & ratings (average + individual reviews)
- "Place Order" CTA button

### 2.4 Order Placement
Order form captures:
- Selected product type & design customizations
- Customer location (delivery address)
- Body measurements (guided by measurement templates per garment)
- Saved measurement profiles (reusable)
- Reference images (optional uploads)
- Fabric preference (tailor-provided / self-provided)
- Special instructions (free text)
- Preferred delivery date

### 2.5 Order Tracking
- Real-time status: `Placed → Accepted → In Progress → Shipped → Delivered`
- Push / in-app notifications on status changes
- Order history with re-order option

### 2.6 Reviews & Ratings
- Rate tailor 1–5 stars after delivery
- Write text review
- Upload photos of received product
- Edit/delete own reviews

### 2.7 Messaging
- In-app chat with tailor (text + image sharing)
- Chat history preserved per order

---

## 3. Tailor Features

### 3.1 Profile Management
- Edit profile: bio, specializations, experience, location, service area
- Set starting prices per product category
- Upload / manage portfolio gallery

### 3.2 Order Management
- View incoming orders with full details
- **Accept / Reject** orders (with reject reason)
- Update order status as work progresses
- Set estimated delivery date upon acceptance
- View order history & earnings summary

### 3.3 Dashboard
- Pending orders count
- Earnings this month
- Average rating
- Recent reviews

### 3.4 Messaging
- In-app chat with customers
- Clarify measurements / design details before starting work

---

## 4. Admin Panel (Must-Haves Only)

### 4.1 User Management
- View / search all customers & tailors
- Activate / deactivate / ban accounts

### 4.2 Tailor Verification
- Queue of pending tailor applications
- View submitted documents
- Approve / reject with reason

### 4.3 Order Management
- View all platform orders, filter by status / date / tailor / customer
- Intervene in stuck or disputed orders

### 4.4 Dispute & Refund Management
- Customer-raised disputes dashboard
- View dispute details (order, complaint, evidence photos)
- Mediate and issue refunds

### 4.5 Review Moderation
- Flagged / reported reviews queue
- Remove fake or abusive reviews

### 4.6 Content Moderation
- Review uploaded portfolio / product images
- Remove inappropriate content

### 4.7 Platform Settings
- Manage product categories & sub-categories
- Set platform commission percentage
- Configure supported delivery locations

---

## 5. Pricing & Payments

| Aspect | Decision |
|--------|----------|
| **Pricing model** | Tailor sets starting prices per category; sends final quote after reviewing order |
| **Customer pays** | Advance (50%) on order acceptance + Balance before shipping |
| **Payment gateway** | **Razorpay** (UPI, cards, netbanking, wallets) — test mode for project |
| **Platform commission** | Configurable % deducted from tailor payout |
| **Refunds** | Admin-initiated via dispute resolution |
| **Invoices** | Auto-generated PDF receipt per order |

---

## 6. Measurement System

- **Guided measurement templates** per garment type with illustrations
- **Saved profiles** — "My measurements", "Mom's measurements", etc.
- Different templates: shirt, trousers, kurta, blouse, lehenga, suit, etc.
- Required vs. optional measurement fields per garment

---

## 7. Delivery & Logistics

- Tailor ships via **third-party courier** (Shiprocket / manual tracking number entry)
- Tracking number shared with customer
- **Self-pickup** option for local orders
- Shipping cost added to order total (set by tailor or flat rate)

---

## 8. Notifications

| Event | Channel |
|-------|---------|
| Order placed / accepted / rejected | Push + In-app |
| Order status change | Push + In-app |
| New message received | Push + In-app |
| New review on profile (tailor) | In-app |
| Dispute update | In-app + Email |

---

## 9. Non-Functional Requirements

- **Responsive web** (desktop + tablet + mobile)
- **Mobile app** (Android — via React Native)
- **Language**: English (Hindi as stretch goal)
- **Image optimization** (compressed uploads, CDN delivery)
- **Security**: password hashing (bcrypt), input validation, rate limiting
- **Data**: DPDP Act aware — user data deletion support
